{"4903560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nothing Goes Right: Bad Business", "steam_appid": 4903560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nothing Goes Right: Bad Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Running a restaurant sounds simple... until the city fights back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nothing Goes Right: Bad Business</strong> is a co-op restaurant management game where every good day creates new problems. Cook meals, serve customers, manage money, and survive a city full of crime, chaos, and bad luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Success is not the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survival is.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903560/extras/47aa693369db7facde6b041c29701338.poster.avif?t=1788164188\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903560/extras/47aa693369db7facde6b041c29701338.webm?t=1788164188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903560/extras/47aa693369db7facde6b041c29701338.mp4?t=1788164188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Work Together or Fall Apart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or with friends as you split up the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cook meals. Serve customers. Buy supplies. Handle emergencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The 