oice Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the end of each day, bills still need to be paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do you buy groceries, repair equipment, or save money for tomorrow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bad decisions carry over and make the next day harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903560/extras/5139696904c5af5a219562e7d636768f.poster.avif?t=1788164188\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903560/extras/5139696904c5af5a219562e7d636768f.webm?t=1788164188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903560/extras/5139696904c5af5a219562e7d636768f.mp4?t=1788164188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Better You Do, the Harder It Gets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More customers mean more money... and more attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As your restaurant grows, so do the costs, threats, and problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Online co-op and solo play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fast-paced restaurant management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dynamic economy and reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Random events and escalating chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Consequences that carry into the next day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hidden secrets and multip